@startuml
!theme mars
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Admin / Teknisi" as Admin
boundary "Halaman Hotspot" as UI
control "Sistem" as System
database "DB Hotspot" as DB
participant "MikroTik\nRouter" as MT

== Generate Voucher Hotspot ==

Admin -> UI : Input jumlah &\npilih Hotspot Profile
activate UI
UI -> System : POST /api/hotspot/generate
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Ambil parameter profil\n(speed, validity, harga)
activate DB
DB --> System : Data profil
deactivate DB

System -> System : Generate username/password\n& hitung kedaluwarsa
System -> DB : INSERT batch hotspot_users
activate DB
DB --> System : Generated IDs
deactivate DB

System -> DB : INSERT log penjualan
activate DB
DB --> System : Log tersimpan
deactivate DB

System -> MT : Buat Hotspot User\ndi router (batch)
activate MT
MT --> System : Jumlah sukses/gagal
deactivate MT

System --> UI : Daftar voucher
deactivate System
activate UI
UI --> Admin : Tampilkan voucher siap cetak
deactivate UI

== Cetak Voucher ==

Admin -> UI : Pilih voucher & klik Cetak
activate UI
UI -> System : GET /api/hotspot/vouchers/:id/print
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Query detail voucher & profil
activate DB
DB --> System : Data terformat
deactivate DB

System -> System : Generate template cetak
System --> UI : File stream / download URL
deactivate System
activate UI
UI --> Admin : Download & cetak voucher
deactivate UI

== Monitoring Session Aktif ==

Admin -> UI : Buka Dashboard Hotspot
activate UI
UI -> System : GET /api/hotspot/active-sessions
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> MT : Ambil daftar\nhotspot user aktif
activate MT
MT --> System : Daftar user aktif\n(IP, MAC, Uptime)
deactivate MT

System -> System : Cocokkan session\ndengan data di database
System -> DB : UPDATE status = online,\nlast_seen = NOW()
activate DB
DB --> System : Berhasil
deactivate DB

System -> DB : UPDATE rekap laporan
activate DB
DB --> System : Berhasil
deactivate DB

System --> UI : Data user aktif & statistik
deactivate System
activate UI
UI --> Admin : Tampilkan user online\n& statistik real-time
deactivate UI

note right of Admin
  Voucher sync: DB <-> MikroTik.
  Monitoring: MikroTik -> Sistem -> DB.
  Laporan penjualan otomatis tercatat.
  Cetak voucher: PDF/HTML.
end note

@enduml
